  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KS Institutional Cooperation between Norwegian and Ukrainian Municipalities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The pre-project aims to strengthen good governance at the local level in Ukraine. Institutional cooperation between municipalities in Norway and Ukraine is expected to contribute to improving Ukrainian municipalities&apos; capacity for planning, service delivery and responsiveness to citizens&apos; needs.</narrative>
  </description>
